      "text": "[7:40AM] #Ilkotun\n#Ejigbo\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nVehicular movement from the stretch of Oke afa down to Oju  odo is free.\nOju odo inward Ikotun intersection down to Old garage is moving slowly as a result of commercial activities and ongoing alternation at the intersection.\n\nThe return journey from Old garage to Oju odo is also busy.\nFrom Oju odo down to Oke afa is  moving freely with a bit of hitch at MRS due to the failed portion of the road.\nNNPC inward and outward Mubostic is good to go at the moment. \nDrive carefully at all time.\n#FollowLASTMA",
