      "text": "2026 RIIZE CONCERT TOUR [RIIZING LOUD] IN MANILA \n\nMANILA BRIIZE, IT'S YOUR TURN!\n\nRIIZE is ready to once again fire up the Philippine stage for their comeback concert #RIIZINGLOUD_IN_MANILA ❤️‍🔥\n\nWhat's in it for you?\n✅ All new stage\n✅ All new performances \n✅ Don’t miss their first full concert in Manila, featuring a full spectrum of performances!\n✅ Shotaro, Eunseok, Sungchan, Wonbin, Sohee, and Anton 😌\n\n🎟️ Tickets now available! \nhttps://t.co/neYZFpGXpn | https://t.co/2K37P7F4TN\n\n#RIIZE #라이즈\n#RISEandREALIZE\n#RIIZE_CONCERT #RIIZINGLOUD #RIIZINGLOUD_IN_MANILA\n#YJPARTNERS\n#MMIC #STORMEXENT #MMICINMANILA #CDM",
